WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:07.060
Fury the Merciless: We are here to meet the Legendary Orc who has been reborn!

2
00:00:08.600 --> 00:00:14.660
Fury the Merciless: Warriors, face forward! Our future leader is coming!

3
00:00:16.360 --> 00:00:21.480
Fury the Merciless: Our wise shaman realized that these aliens are part of the prophecy!

4
00:00:21.480 --> 00:00:25.680
Fury the Merciless: With her magic, this redhead... I mean the mighty Eladia...

5
00:00:27.080 --> 00:00:31.480
Fury the Merciless: will open the portal and reach the one we've been waiting for!

6
00:00:31.900 --> 00:00:36.400
Fury the Merciless: He will come to us, and a new era will begin!

7
00:00:37.700 --> 00:00:39.800
Fury the Merciless: Begin!

8
00:01:03.760 --> 00:01:07.360
Fury the Merciless: Look! He is here! He has arrived!

9
00:01:08.960 --> 00:01:11.360
Landfill Warrior: Glory to the new Horde!

10
00:01:14.630 --> 00:01:19.830
Landfill Warrior: The world will fall at our feet! The Orcs will rule the world!
